; c16-2t-spread. Anchor: shot-0233 (Ch. 16, two high trumps).
; Printed: 0.40 (90 of 225 placements).
; Claim: holding only the two top trumps, no other hand holds more than two
;   of the five missing trumps.
; State: the bidder's seven tiles, nothing played; the 21 others dealt
;   uniformly, seven to each other seat.
; Exact: 147/323. Book model: 90/243 = 10/27 (there are 243 placements, not
;   225; 90/225 is the printed 0.40).
(query
  (none (roles a b c x)
    (in a q*)
    (in b q*)
    (in c q*)
    (not (viewer x))
    (holds x a)
    (holds x b)
    (holds x c)))
